            <description><![CDATA[<h2>DHCP Bench 0.2.0</h2>
<ul>
  <li>DHCP Bench now updates itself. It checks once a day and asks before installing, never while the server is running.</li>
  <li>New: DHCP Bench &gt; Check for Updates&hellip;, and a Settings switch for the daily check.</li>
  <li>The <code>dhcpbench</code> command now lives inside the app, so it always matches the app's version.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
